title: Sign-Based Lighting & Traffic Sign Deglare (SBLM & TSDG)
raw_community_title: Sign-Based Light Mode & Traffic Sign Deglare
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: Lariat / Platinum / Flash (Matrix LED Headlamps)
source_sheet: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix LED & Euro Ranger Platinum Comparison + Livnitup
  Master Database
author: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
validated: false
status: unvalidated
notes: 'Enables two camera-driven road sign lighting features used on European Ford
  Matrix LED headlamps alongside the required IPMA camera sign-recognition feeds
  (MFCTSR & MFCTSRSY):

  (1) Sign-Based Light Mode (SBLM) uses the IPMA front camera to recognize approaching
  junctions, roundabouts, yield, and stop signs and pre-widens the headlight beam
  into the intersection.

  (2) Traffic Sign Deglare (TSDG) dims the specific Matrix high-beam LEDs shining
  directly onto highly reflective road signs so they do not dazzle the driver when
  Glare-Free High Beams are actively engaged.

  NOTE — HCM CHECKSUM PLACEHOLDERS: The 734-11-01 checksum nibbles below are currently
  set to placeholder zeros (0000 00) because the exact GF(2) CRC for this combination
  has not been finalized yet. Do NOT flash the HCM changes without computing a valid
  734-11-01 CRC for your configuration, or the HCM will set U2100 / B104A.

  NOTE — 734-05-01 & 734-01-02: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix leaves HCM 734-01-02 nibble
  1 (TSDGE) at 0 and sets 734-05-01 nibble 7 (SLME) to 1 (SLME Enable); if testing
  2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare ON) produces no SBLM intersection widening, test 1
  (or 3).'
steps:
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-01
  notes: 'Add +2 to existing nibble 2 value (e.g., 0 -> 2, or 1 -> 3 if IACC is
    enabled) to enable ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR (MFCTSR = SLOIF).'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR (MFCTSR)
      target_state: MFCTSR SLOIF
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-01
  notes: 'Add +2 to existing nibble 3 value (e.g., 0 -> 2) to enable ModuleFeatureCfg_SBLM.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_SBLM (MFCSBLM)
      target_state: MFCSBLM Enabled
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 2 value (e.g., 0 -> 8) to enable Stop/Yield Sign
    Recognition in the IPMA.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '8'
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR_StopYield (MFCTSRSY)
      target_state: MFCTSRSY Enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-03-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 2 value (e.g., 4 -> C) to enable Traffic Sign
    Recognition in the IPC.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xx--
    community_hex: C
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)
      target_state: TSR enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-09-02
  notes: 'Add +1 to existing value: 0 -> 1 (trucks without ACC, e.g. Pro) or 2 -> 3
    (trucks with Intelligent ACC). Writing 1 on an ACC-equipped truck will disable
    Intelligent ACC in the IPC.'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xx--'
    community_hex: '1'
    offset_hint: '+1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Adaptive Headlamps Feature (AHF)
      target_state: AHF enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-10-01
  notes: Add +2 to existing value (0 -> 2 across all Lightnings).
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: Predictive Lights (PL)
      target_state: PL enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 9 value (e.g., 5 -> D) to enable Traffic Sign
    Recognition toggle in SYNC 4.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    community_hex: D
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)
      target_state: TSR Enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-01-02
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 1 to enable m2_TSDG_Enable (TSDGE Enable). Note:
    Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix and Euro Ranger Platinum leave this at 0. Requires valid
    734-11-01 CRC.'
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: m2_TSDG_Enable (TSDGE)
      target_state: TSDGE Enable
- module: HCM
  address: 734-05-01
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare ON) or 1 (SLME Enable,
    matching Euro Kuga Matrix). Requires valid 734-11-01 CRC.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxx* xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: m2_SbLM_Enable (SLME)
      target_state: SLME Traffic sign deglare ON
- module: HCM
  address: 734-11-01
  notes: 'PLACEHOLDER HCM calibration CRC & line checksum block (0000 00) — exact
    CRC values are not yet finalized for this configuration. Replace with the
    recalculated 16-bit CRC + line checksum before flashing.'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx x*xx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
recipe_version: '1.1'
